# Leave unset to run against local data files and localStorage.
# `npm run dev` normally has no .env at all, which is what you want locally.
#
# The origin only -- api.ts appends /api/... itself:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://serinegaradialogue.org
#
# Production is configured in .env.production, which IS committed because it
# holds nothing secret. Never put a token or password in any VITE_ variable:
# they are compiled into the public bundle.
